>\n<div class=\"fr\">\n<h1 class=\"title-h1\">4'' Submersible Peripheral Pump</h1>\n<p>4'' submersible peripheral pump JIADI pump industry is specialized in the design and manufacture of submersible pumps like 4'' submersible peripheral pump. It is present on markets around the world under its own brand. Company’s priority is the continued commitment in study and...</p>\n<a class=\"special_read\" href=\"#p1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Send Inquiry</a>\n<div class=\"share-btn-list\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"watch_botton\">\n<div class=\"button_box\">\n<button class=\"the_first\">Product Details</button>\n<p><input id=\"productID\" name=\"productID\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"52493537\"/></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808270918485929527.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image005(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>4'' submersible peripheral pump</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808270918564564335.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image007(001).jpg\"/></p><p>JIADI pump industry is specialized in the design and manufacture of submersible pumps like 4'' submersible peripheral pump. It is present on markets around the world under its own brand. Company’s priority is the continued commitment in study and development of innovative products that can continue to compete on the global market.</p><p><strong>1. Products Parameter (specification)</strong></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td><p style=\"text-align:left;\"><strong>Power</strong></p></td><td width=\"225\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">0.75, 1.1, 1.5kw/1, 1.5, 2Hp</p></td><td width=\"94\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\"><strong>Brand</strong></p></td><td width=\"138\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">JIADI</p></td></tr><tr><td><p style=\"text-align:left;\"><strong>Model</strong></p></td><td width=\"225\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">4SKm</p></td><td width=\"94\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\"><strong>impeller</strong></p></td><td width=\"138\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">copper</p></td></tr><tr><td><p style=\"text-align:left;\"><strong>Motor</strong></p></td><td width=\"225\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">electric</p></td><td width=\"94\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\"><strong>Max. Diameter</strong></p></td><td width=\"138\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">95mm</p></td></tr><tr><td><p style=\"text-align:left;\"><strong>MOQ</strong></p></td><td width=\"225\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">50 pcs/ sample request is accepted</p></td><td width=\"94\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\"><strong>Warranty</strong></p></td><td width=\"138\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">1 year</p></td></tr><tr><td><p style=\"text-align:left;\"><strong>Phase</strong></p></td><td width=\"225\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Single phase/Three phase</p></td><td width=\"94\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\"><strong>Voltage</strong></p></td><td width=\"138\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">220-240V<br/>380-415V</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>2. Performance Curve</strong></p><p></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808270920599769712.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image009.jpg\"/></p><p><strong>3. Spare Parts</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808270921016471664.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image011.jpg\"/></p><p><strong>4. Product Application</strong></p><p>1. Sewage treatment, agriculture, construction, water circulate, tunnel, bridge, river</p><p>2. Fish ponds, swimming pool, pond, rain, infiltration water</p><p>3. Water supply engineering, sewerage, wastewater engineering, water source, surface water</p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808270921544011477.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image013(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>5. Company Profile</strong></p><p>JIADI is one of the leading brands in the Weling, Taizhou and commercial pump market. We will provide efficient and reliable products, services and solutions for the water supply and water pumping needs in the residential, irrigation, building services and commercial markets worldwide. Based the high quality, our machinery seldom have problems. If our machines have some trouble, our engineer and technician will solve them within 24 hours. We will offer you the details about the product, welcome to contact me for more information and enquiry.</p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808270921592214320.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image015.jpg\"/></p><p><strong>6. Advantages</strong></p><p>1. Italian pump production technology.</p><p>2. Slight motor heating, overload protection.</p><p>3. High efficiency.</p><p>4. Proper way of stainless steel treatment; pumps are environment friendly.</p><p>5. Motor oil and seal lubricant oil is the oil for the food industry.</p><p>6. Sand resistance.</p><p>7. Assembling accuracy.</p><p>8. Low energy consumption.</p><p>9. Long service life. </p><p>10. Various types of controller box.</p><p><strong>7. Exhibition</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808270922035060261.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image017(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>8. FAQ</strong></p><p><strong>1. Q: How about the packing?</strong></p><p>A：Carton is mostly used, while plywood box and pallet will be used when necessary or as request.</p><p><strong>2. Q: Are you a factory or a trading company?</strong></p><p>A: We are a manufacture specialized in researching and developing pumps for many years. We are confident in the quality of our products.</p><p><strong>3. Q: What about export details?</strong></p><p>A: We could arrange all the pump export things for our customers, about declare the customs, ship the pump to the port and offer related pump Certifications etc.</p><p><strong>4. Q: How to control the products quality in your company?</strong></p><p>A: With professional quality team, advanced product quality planning, strict implementation, continuous improvement, the quality of our products is well controlled and consistent.</p><p><strong><br/></strong><br/></p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"